{"suttaId":"thig4.1","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Thī","vriCode":"s0509m.mul","paras":[280,293],"vripara":"63"},"segments":{"thig4.1:0.3":"Bhaddākāpilānītherīgāthā","thig4.1:1.1":"“Putto buddhassa dāyādo, kassapo susamāhito;","thig4.1:1.3":"Pubbenivāsaṃ yovedi, saggāpāyañca passati.","thig4.1:2.1":"“Atho jātikkhayaṃ patto, abhiññāvosito muni;","thig4.1:2.3":"Etāhi tīhi vijjāhi, tevijjo hoti brāhmaṇo.","thig4.1:3.1":"“Tatheva bhaddā kāpilānī, tevijjā maccuhāyinī;","thig4.1:3.3":"Dhāreti antimaṃ dehaṃ, jetvā māraṃ savāhanaṃ.","thig4.1:4.1":"“Disvā ādīnavaṃ loke, ubho pabbajitā mayaṃ;","thig4.1:4.3":"Tyamha khīṇāsavā dantā, sītibhūtamha nibbutā”ti.","thig4.1:5.1":"… Bhaddā kāpilānī therī ….","thig4.1:6.1":"Catukkanipāto niṭṭhito."},"attha":{"book":"Thī-a","bookName":"Therīgāthā-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0509a.att","from":1104,"to":1104,"paras":[{"para":1104,"vripara":null,"refs":["thig4.1:4"],"lines":["Idāni yathā therassa paṭipatti ādimajjhapariyosānakalyāṇā, evaṃ mamapīti dassentī <b>“disvā ādīnavan”</b>ti osānagāthamāha.","Tattha <b>tyamha khīṇāsavā dantā</b>ti te mayaṃ mahākassapatthero ahañca uttamena damena dantā sabbaso khīṇāsavā ca amha.","<b>Sītibhūtāmha nibbutā</b>ti tato eva kilesapariḷāhābhāvato sītibhūtā saupādisesāya nibbānadhātuyā nibbutā ca amha bhavāmāti attho."],"lineRefs":[["thig4.1:4"],["thig4.1:4"],["thig4.1:4"]]}],"wordLinks":[["thig4.1:4.1","disvā ādīnavaṃ",0,0],["thig4.1:4.3","tyamha khīṇāsavā dantā",0,1]],"before":[{"para":947,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Somātherīgāthāvaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":948,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Tikanipātavaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":949,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Catukkanipāto"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":950,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Bhaddākāpilānītherīgāthāvaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":951,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Catukkanipāte <b>putto buddhassa dāyādo</b>tiādikā bhaddāya kāpilāniyā theriyā gāthā.","Sā kira padumuttarassa bhagavato kāle haṃsavatīnagare kulagehe nibbattitvā viññutaṃ patvā satthu santike dhammaṃ suṇantī satthāraṃ ekaṃ bhikkhuniṃ pubbenivāsaṃ anussarantīnaṃ aggaṭṭhāne ṭhapentaṃ disvā adhikārakammaṃ katvā sayampi taṃ ṭhānantaraṃ patthetvā yāvajīvaṃ puññāni katvā tato cutā devamanussesu saṃsarantī anuppanne buddhe bārāṇasiyaṃ kulagehe nibbattitvā patikulaṃ gantvā, ekadivasaṃ attano nanandāya saddhiṃ kalahaṃ karontī tāya paccekabuddhassa piṇḍapāte dinne “ayaṃ imassa dānaṃ datvā uḷārasampattiṃ labhissatī”ti paccekabuddhassa hatthato pattaṃ gahetvā bhattaṃ chaḍḍetvā kalalassa pūretvā adāsi.","Mahājano garahi –","“bāle, paccekabuddho te kiṃ aparajjhī”ti?","Sā tesaṃ vacanena lajjamānā puna pattaṃ gahetvā kalalaṃ nīharitvā dhovitvā gandhacuṇṇena ubbaṭṭetvā catumadhurassa pūretvā upari āsittena padumagabbhavaṇṇena sappinā vijjotamānaṃ paccekabuddhassa hatthe ṭhapetvā “yathā ayaṃ piṇḍapāto obhāsajāto, evaṃ obhāsajātaṃ me sarīraṃ hotū”ti patthanaṃ paṭṭhapesi.","Sā tato cavitvā sugatīsuyeva saṃsarantī kassapabuddhakāle bārāṇasiyaṃ mahāvibhavassa seṭṭhino dhītā hutvā nibbatti.","Pubbakammaphalena duggandhasarīrā manussehi jigucchitabbā hutvā saṃvegajātā attano ābharaṇehi suvaṇṇiṭṭhakaṃ kāretvā bhagavato cetiye patiṭṭhapesi, uppalahatthena ca pūjaṃ akāsi.","Tenassā sarīraṃ tasmiṃyeva bhave sugandhaṃ manoharaṃ jātaṃ.","Sā patino piyā manāpā hutvā yāvajīvaṃ kusalaṃ katvā tato cutā sagge nibbatti.","Tatthāpi yāvajīvaṃ dibbasukhaṃ anubhavitvā, tato cutā bārāṇasirañño dhītā hutvā tattha devasampattisadisaṃ sampattiṃ anubhavantī cirakālaṃ paccekabuddhe upaṭṭhahitvā, tesu parinibbutesu saṃvegajātā tāpasapabbajjāya pabbajitvā uyyāne vasantī jhānāni bhāvetvā brahmaloke nibbattitvā tato cutā sāgalanagare kosiyagottassa brāhmaṇakulassa gehe nibbattitvā mahatā parihārena vaḍḍhitvā vayappattā mahātitthagāme pipphalikumārassa gehaṃ nītā.","Tasmiṃ pabbajituṃ nikkhante mahantaṃ bhogakkhandhaṃ mahantañca ñātiparivaṭṭaṃ pahāya pabbajjatthāya nikkhamitvā pañca vassāni titthiyārāme pavisitvā aparabhāge mahāpajāpatigotamiyā santike pabbajjaṃ upasampadañca labhitvā vipassanaṃ paṭṭhapetvā na cirasseva arahattaṃ pāpuṇi.","Tena vuttaṃ <b>apadāne</b> (apa. therī 2.3.244-313)–"],"lineRefs":[[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[]]},{"para":952,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Padumuttaro nāma jino, sabbadhammāna pāragū;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":953,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Ito satasahassamhi, kappe uppajji nāyako."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":954,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Tadāhu haṃsavatiyaṃ, videho nāma nāmato;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":955,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Seṭṭhī pahūtaratano, tassa jāyā ahosahaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":956,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Kadāci so narādiccaṃ, upecca saparijjano;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":957,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Dhammamassosi buddhassa, sabbadukkhabhayappahaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":958,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Sāvakaṃ dhutavādānaṃ, aggaṃ kittesi nāyako;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":959,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Sutvā sattāhikaṃ dānaṃ, datvā buddhassa tādino."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":960,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Nipacca sirasā pāde, taṃ ṭhānamabhipatthayiṃ;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":961,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Sa hāsayanto parisaṃ, tadā hi narapuṅgavo."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":962,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Seṭṭhino anukampāya, imā gāthā abhāsatha;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":963,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Lacchase patthitaṃ ṭhānaṃ, nibbuto hohi puttaka."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":964,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Satasahassito kappe, okkākakulasambhavo;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":965,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Gotamo nāma gottena, satthā loke bhavissati."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":966,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Tassa dhammesu dāyādo, oraso dhammanimmito;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":967,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Kassapo nāma gottena, hessati satthu sāvako."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":968,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Taṃ sutvā mudito hutvā, yāvajīvaṃ tadā jinaṃ;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":969,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Mettacitto paricari, paccayehi vināyakaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":970,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Sāsanaṃ jotayitvāna, so madditvā kutitthiye;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":971,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Veneyyaṃ vinayitvā ca, nibbuto so sasāvako."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":972,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Nibbute tamhi lokagge, pūjanatthāya satthuno;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":973,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Ñātimitte samānetvā, saha tehi akārayi."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":974,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Sattayojanikaṃ thūpaṃ, ubbiddhaṃ ratanāmayaṃ;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":975,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Jalantaṃ sataraṃsiṃva, sālarājaṃva phullitaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":976,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Sattasatasahassāni, pātiyo tattha kārayi;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":977,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Naḷaggī viya jotantī, rataneheva sattahi."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":978,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Gandhatelena pūretvā, dīpānujjalayī tahiṃ;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":979,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Pūjanatthāya mahesissa, sabbabhūtānukampino."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":980,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Sattasatasahassāni, puṇṇakumbhāni kārayi;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":981,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Rataneheva puṇṇāni, pūjanatthāya mahesino."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":982,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Majjhe aṭṭhaṭṭhakumbhīnaṃ, ussitā kañcanagghiyo;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":983,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Atirocanti vaṇṇena, saradeva divākaro."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":984,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Catudvāresu sobhanti, toraṇā ratanāmayā;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":985,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Ussitā phalakā rammā, sobhanti ratanāmayā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":986,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Virocanti parikkhittā, avaṭaṃsā sunimmitā;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":987,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Ussitāni paṭākāni, ratanāni virocare."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":988,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Surattaṃ sukataṃ cittaṃ, cetiyaṃ ratanāmayaṃ;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":989,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Atirocati vaṇṇena, sasañjhova divākaro."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":990,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Thūpassa vediyo tisso, haritālena pūrayi;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":991,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Ekaṃ manosilāyekaṃ, añjanena ca ekikaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":992,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Pūjaṃ etādisaṃ rammaṃ, kāretvā varavādino;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":993,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Adāsi dānaṃ saṅghassa, yāvajīvaṃ yathābalaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":994,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Sahāva seṭṭhinā tena, tāni puññāni sabbaso;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":995,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Yāvajīvaṃ karitvāna, sahāva sugatiṃ gatā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":996,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Sampattiyonubhotvāna, devatte atha mānuse;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":997,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Chāyā viya sarīrena, saha teneva saṃsariṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":998,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Ekanavutito kappe, vipassī nāma nāyako;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":999,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Uppajji cārudassano, sabbadhammavipassako."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1000,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Tadāyaṃ bandhupatiyaṃ, brāhmaṇo sādhusammato;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1001,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Aḍḍho santo guṇenāpi, dhanena ca suduggato."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1002,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Tadāpi tassāhaṃ āsiṃ, brāhmaṇī samacetasā;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1003,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Kadāci so dijavaro, saṅgamesi mahāmuniṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1004,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Nisinnaṃ janakāyamhi, desentaṃ amataṃ padaṃ;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1005,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Sutvā dhammaṃ pamudito, adāsi ekasāṭakaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1006,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Gharamekena vatthena, gantvānetaṃ sa mabravi;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1007,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Anumoda mahāpuññaṃ, dinnaṃ buddhassa sāṭakaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1008,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Tadāhaṃ añjaliṃ katvā, anumodiṃ supīṇitā;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1009,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Sudinno sāṭako sāmi, buddhaseṭṭhassa tādino."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1010,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Sukhito sajjito hutvā, saṃsaranto bhavābhave;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1011,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Bārāṇasipure ramme, rājā āsi mahīpati."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1012,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Tadā tassa mahesīhaṃ, itthigumbassa uttamā;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1013,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Tassāti dayitā āsiṃ, pubbasnehena bhattuno."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1014,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Piṇḍāya vicarante te, aṭṭha paccekanāyake;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1015,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Disvā pamudito hutvā, datvā piṇḍaṃ mahārahaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1016,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Puno nimantayitvāna, katvā ratanamaṇḍapaṃ;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1017,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Kammārehi kataṃ pattaṃ, sovaṇṇaṃ vata tattakaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1018,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Samānetvāna te sabbe, tesaṃ dānamadāsi so;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1019,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Soṇṇāsane paviṭṭhānaṃ, pasanno sehi pāṇibhi."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1020,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Tampi dānaṃ sahādāsiṃ, kāsirājenahaṃ tadā;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1021,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Punāhaṃ bārāṇasiyaṃ, jātā kāsikagāmake."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1022,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Kuṭumbikakule phīte, sukhito so sabhātuko;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1023,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Jeṭṭhassa bhātuno jāyā, ahosiṃ supatibbatā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1024,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Paccekabuddhaṃ disvāna, kaniyassa mama bhattuno;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1025,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Bhāgannaṃ tassa datvāna, āgate tamhi pāvadiṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1026,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Nābhinandittha so dānaṃ, tato tassa adāsahaṃ;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1027,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Ukhā āniya taṃ annaṃ, puno tasseva so adā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1028,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Tadannaṃ chaḍḍayitvāna, duṭṭhā buddhassahaṃ tadā;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1029,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Pattaṃ kalalapuṇṇaṃ taṃ, adāsiṃ tassa tādino."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1030,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Dāne ca gahaṇe ceva, apace padusepi ca;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1031,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Samacittamukhaṃ disvā, tadāhaṃ saṃvijiṃ bhusaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1032,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Puno pattaṃ gahetvāna, sodhayitvā sugandhinā,"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1033,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Pasannacittā pūretvā, saghataṃ sakkaraṃ adaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1034,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Yattha yatthūpapajjāmi, surūpā homi dānato;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1035,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Buddhassa apakārena, duggandhā vadanena ca."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1036,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Puna kassapavīrassa, nidhāyantamhi cetiye;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1037,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Sovaṇṇaṃ iṭṭhakaṃ varaṃ, adāsiṃ muditā ahaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1038,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Catujjātena gandhena, nicayitvā tamiṭṭhakaṃ;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1039,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Muttā duggandhadosamhā, sabbaṅgasusamāgatā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1040,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Satta pātisahassāni, rataneheva sattahi;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1041,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Kāretvā ghatapūrāni, vaṭṭīni ca sahassaso."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1042,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Pakkhipitvā padīpetvā, ṭhapayiṃ sattapantiyo;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1043,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Pūjanatthaṃ lokanāthassa, vippasannena cetasā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1044,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Tadāpi tamhi puññamhi, bhāginīyi visesato;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1045,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Puna kāsīsu sañjāto, sumittā iti vissuto."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1046,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Tassāhaṃ bhariyā āsiṃ, sukhitā sajjitā piyā;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1047,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Tadā paccekamunino, adāsiṃ ghanaveṭhanaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1048,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Tassāpi bhāginī āsiṃ, moditvā dānamuttamaṃ;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1049,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Punāpi kāsiraṭṭhamhi, jāto koliyajātiyā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1050,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Tadā koliyaputtānaṃ, satehi saha pañcahi;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1051,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Pañca paccekabuddhānaṃ, satāni samupaṭṭhahi."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1052,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Temāsaṃ tappayitvāna, adāsi ca ticīvare;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1053,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Jāyā tassa tadā āsiṃ, puññakammapathānugā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1054,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Tato cuto ahu rājā, nando nāma mahāyaso;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1055,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Tassāpi mahesī āsiṃ, sabbakāmasamiddhinī."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1056,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Tadā rājā bhavitvāna, brahmadatto mahīpati;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1057,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Padumavatīputtānaṃ, paccekamuninaṃ tadā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1058,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Satāni pañcanūnāni, yāvajīvaṃ upaṭṭhahiṃ;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1059,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Rājuyyāne nivāsetvā, nibbutāni ca pūjayiṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1060,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Cetiyāni ca kāretvā, pabbajitvā ubho mayaṃ;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1061,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Bhāvetvā appamaññāyo, brahmalokaṃ agamhase."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1062,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Tato cuto mahātitthe, sujāto pipphalāyano;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1063,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Mātā sumanadevīti, kosigotto dijo pitā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1064,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Ahaṃ madde janapade, sākalāya puruttame;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1065,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Kappilassa dijassāsiṃ, dhītā mātā sucīmati."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1066,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Gharakañcanabimbena, nimminitvāna maṃ pitā;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1067,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Adā kassapadhīrassa, kāmehi vajjitassamaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1068,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Kadāci so kāruṇiko, gantvā kammantapekkhako;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1069,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Kākādikehi khajjante, pāṇe disvāna saṃviji."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1070,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Gharevāhaṃ tile jāte, disvānātapatāpane;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1071,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Kimī kākehi khajjante, saṃvegamalabhiṃ tadā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1072,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Tadā so pabbajī dhīro, ahaṃ tamanupabbajiṃ;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1073,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Pañca vassāni nivasiṃ, paribbājavate ahaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1074,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Yadā pabbajitā āsi, gotamī jinaposikā;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1075,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Tadāhaṃ tamupagantvā, buddhena anusāsitā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1076,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Na cireneva kālena, arahattamapāpuṇiṃ;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1077,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Aho kalyāṇamittattaṃ, kassapassa sirīmato."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1078,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Suto buddhassa dāyādo, kassapo susamāhito;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1079,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Pubbenivāsaṃ yo vedi, saggāpāyañca passati."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1080,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Atho jātikkhayaṃ patto, abhiññāvosito muni;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1081,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Etāhi tīhi vijjāhi, tevijjo hoti brāhmaṇo."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1082,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Tatheva bhaddākāpilānī, tevijjā maccuhāyinī;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1083,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Dhāreti antimaṃ dehaṃ, jitvā māraṃ savāhanaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1084,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Disvā ādīnavaṃ loke, ubho pabbajitā mayaṃ;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1085,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Tyamha khīṇāsavā dantā, sītibhūtāmha nibbutā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1086,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanan”ti.(apa. therī 2.3.244-313);"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1087,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Arahattaṃ pana patvā pubbenivāsañāṇe ciṇṇavasī ahosi.","Tattha sātisayaṃ katādhikārattā aparabhāge taṃ satthā jetavane ariyagaṇamajjhe nisinno bhikkhuniyo paṭipāṭiyā ṭhānantaresu ṭhapento pubbenivāsaṃ anussarantīnaṃ aggaṭṭhāne ṭhapesi.","Sā ekadivasaṃ mahākassapattherassa guṇābhitthavanapubbakaṃ attano katakiccatādivibhāvanamukhena udānaṃ udānentī –"],"lineRefs":[[],[],[]]},{"para":1089,"vripara":"63","refs":[],"lines":["“Putto buddhassa dāyādo, kassapo susamāhito;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1090,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Pubbenivāsaṃ yovedi, saggāpāyañca passati."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1092,"vripara":"64","refs":[],"lines":["“Atho jātikkhayaṃ patto, abhiññāvosito muni;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1093,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Etāhi tīhi vijjāhi, tevijjo hoti brāhmaṇo."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1095,"vripara":"65","refs":[],"lines":["“Tatheva bhaddākāpilānī, tevijjā maccuhāyinī;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1096,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Dhāreti antimaṃ dehaṃ, jetvā māraṃ savāhanaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1098,"vripara":"66","refs":[],"lines":["“Disvā ādīnavaṃ loke, ubho pabbajitā mayaṃ;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1099,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Tyamha khīṇāsavā dantā, sītibhūtāmha nibbutā”ti.","–"],"lineRefs":[[],[]]},{"para":1100,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Imā gāthā abhāsi."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1101,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Tattha <b>putto buddhassa dāyādo</b>ti buddhānubuddhabhāvato sammāsambuddhassa anujātasuto tato eva tassa dāyabhūtassa navalokuttaradhammassa ādānena dāyādo kassapo lokiyalokuttarehi samādhīhi suṭṭhu samāhitacittatāya <b>susamāhito.</b>","<b>Pubbenivāsaṃ yovedī</b>ti yo mahākassapatthero pubbenivāsaṃ attano paresañca nivutthakkhandhasantānaṃ pubbenivāsānussatiñāṇena pākaṭaṃ katvā avedi aññāsi paṭivijjhi.","<b>Saggāpāyañca passatī</b>ti chabbīsatidevalokabhedaṃ saggaṃ catubbidhaṃ apāyañca dibbacakkhunā hatthatale āmalakaṃ viya passati."],"lineRefs":[[],[],[]]},{"para":1102,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["<b>Atho jātikkhayaṃ patto</b>ti tato paraṃ jātikkhayasaṅkhātaṃ arahattaṃ patto.","<b>Abhiññāya</b> abhivisiṭṭhena ñāṇena abhiññeyyaṃ dhammaṃ abhijānitvā pariññeyyaṃ parijānitvā, pahātabbaṃ pahāya, sacchikātabbaṃ sacchikatvā <b>vosito</b> niṭṭhaṃ patto katakicco.","Āsavakkhayapaññāsaṅkhātaṃ monaṃ pattattā <b>muni</b>."],"lineRefs":[[],[],[]]},{"para":1103,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["<b>Tatheva bhaddākāpilānī</b>ti yathā mahākassapo etāhi yathāvuttāhi tīhi vijjāhi tevijjo maccuhāyī ca, tatheva bhaddākāpilānī tevijjā maccuhāyinīti.","Tato eva <b>dhāreti antimaṃ dehaṃ, jetvā māraṃ savāhanan</b>ti attānameva paraṃ viya katvā dasseti."],"lineRefs":[[],[]]}]},"tika":null,"tika2":null}
